   <H1>[Python-Dev] PEP 563: Postponed Evaluation of Annotations</H1>
    <B>Nick Coghlan</B> 
    <A HREF="mailto:python-dev%40python.org?Subject=Re%3A%20%5BPython-Dev%5D%20PEP%20563%3A%20Postponed%20Evaluation%20of%20Annotations&In-Reply-To=%3CCADiSq7fv07qX0sk12uk6NRL8_GhwnQwU-M7uF08p1xby_W%2BXYw%40mail.gmail.com%3E"
       TITLE="[Python-Dev] PEP 563: Postponed Evaluation of Annotations">ncoghlan at gmail.com
       </A><BR>
    <I>Sat Nov  4 09:51:41 EDT 2017</I>
    <P><UL>
        <LI>Previous message (by thread): <A HREF="150109.html">[Python-Dev] PEP 563: Postponed Evaluation of Annotations
</A></li>
